# Soclover

Nx monorepo: Angular client (`soclover/`), Express+WS server (`server/` port 3055), shared package `@soclover/lib-soclover`.

Game loop: create leaf → write 4 clues → submit → others solve by arranging/rotating cards. Sync via WebSocket `PATCH` / `STATE` messages; MongoDB stores submitted leaves.

- Shared types/protocol only in `lib-soclover`
- Client env: `environments/environment.ts` (`localserver` toggle)
- Do not commit secrets, `.env`, or `*.pem`
- Prefer focused diffs; match existing NgModule Angular style
- Full map: see `AGENTS.md`
